# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated paper artifacts.
#
# These are OUTPUTS of finsent.eval.report, never inputs. Committing them invites the
# exact failure this rebuild exists to correct: a table in the repository that nobody
# can trace back to a run. Regenerate with `make reproduce`; every file carries its own
# git sha, config hash, data hash and seed list.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
paper/tables/
paper/figures/
paper/manifest_*.json
runs/

# Cached FinBERT embeddings: large, and derivable from the news corpus plus the
# checkpoint named in configs/base.yaml.
data/cache/

# Experiment tracking
mlruns/
wandb/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated SQL training dumps: 581 files, 6.7 GB, produced by
# finsentnet_pro/backend/data_pipeline/export_training_sql.py. They are regenerable
# output, they exceeded GitHub's push limit on their own, and a repository that cannot
# be cloned is not a reproducible one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
finsentnet_pro/backend/data/sql_training_companies/
finsentnet_pro/backend/data/tunnels/
finsentnet_pro/backend/checkpoints/
*.jsonl

# The Overleaf bundle is a copy of main.tex plus generated tables and figures, so it is
# derived twice over. Regenerate with `make bundle`.
paper/overleaf_bundle/
paper/finsentnet_overleaf.zip
